OL,3,GNEWSA'Exciting' new Victor Hugo Centre
OL,4,Aplans approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned educational and cultural
OL,7,FVictor Hugo Centre has moved a step
OL,8,Fcloser to completion after planning
OL,9,Fpermission was granted.
OL,11,FThe States of Guernsey approved the
OL,12,Fplans to transform the former States
OL,13,FOffice building and information centre
OL,14,Fin St Peter Port.
OL,16,FHugo, spent 15 years in Guernsey from
OL,17,F1855 to 1870 during his exile from
OL,18,FFrance when he wrote his celebrated
OL,19,Fnovels Les Miserables and The Hunchback
OL,20,Fof Notre-Dame.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
