OL,3,GNEWSA'Exciting' new Victor Hugo Centre
OL,4,Aplans approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FLarry Malcic, chair of the Victor Hugo
OL,7,FCentre Guernsey LBG said securing
OL,8,Fplanning permission was a major
OL,9,Fmilestone and was a step closer to
OL,10,Fcreating a permanent Guernsey home for
OL,11,FHugo's "extraordinary legacy".
